":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-13T09:31:23-07:00","id":950091,"title":"","content":"I'd expect to see some incremental innovation as the Unfleshed incorporates things they wish they had, or technology they're into. Considering how they're likely to be hunted or can't work well with human innovators I imagine quite a few end up cobbling their progeny together from whatever is on hand. Or they may not understand the technology that created them. The sentient swarm of nanobots might end up building a dieselpunk progeny because it's not a science guy, but it loves working on cars.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","name":"literatzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4270_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}